<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" dir="ltr">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
<title>Error · Acme</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="&#x2f;t&#x2f;acme&#x2f;assets/anvil.css">
</head>
<body>

<main id="main" aria-labelledby="page-heading">
<p class="anvil-tenant">Acme</p>
<h1 id="page-heading">This app&#x27;s sign-in link is set up wrongly</h1>

<p class="anvil-error-label" id="error-label"><svg class="anvil-icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="12" y1="7" x2="12" y2="13"></line><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"></line></svg> <span>Error</span></p>
<p class="anvil-error-text" id="error-message" data-error-key="redirect_uri_mismatch" role="alert">The redirect URI in this request is not registered for this client.</p>
<p class="anvil-lead" id="error-explanation">The app sent you here with an address it has not registered, so you can&#x27;t sign in from this link. Go back to the app and try again, or tell its operator.</p>

<p class="anvil-muted anvil-status">Error 400</p>
<nav class="anvil-links" aria-label="Next steps">
<a id="link-login" href="&#x2f;t&#x2f;acme&#x2f;ui&#x2f;login?flow=f1">Go to sign in</a>
</nav>


</main>
</body>
</html>
